  "said": [
   "Then, they were weighed to estimate their final wet weight, and finally stored in paper bags.",
   "These samples were later dried in an oven at 80 °C for 72 h to obtain their dry weight 68 .",
   "At each site, we placed ten baited pitfall traps along a 450 m linear transect that were separated from each other by $5 0 \\mathsf { m } ^ { 6 6 }$ .",
   "Each trap consisted of a 3 L plastic bucket buried at ground level and filled with 1.5 L of preservative fluid (water + soap + salt).",
   "It was covered with a 25 × 25 cm plastic or metallic chicken net (2 × 2 cm mesh size) pinned down to the ground 65 .",
   "In some localities, a white plastic dish covered the trap to prevent dung disintegration due to intense rainfall.",
   "Samples were collected after 48 hours.",
   "More details on the field and laboratory protocols can be found in ref."
  ],
  "value": "PreservedSpecimen",
